ors of anti-LGBTQ violence"},"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Survivors of anti-LGBTQ violence"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"People who have experienced and survived anti-LGBTQ+ violence; follow individuals’ preference for “victims” or “survivors” whenever possible."},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000059"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001348"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/survivorsOfAntiLGBTQViolence"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"}},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000060","dc:identifier":"homoit0000060","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-queer discrimination"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"The unjust or prejudicial treatment of queer people due to their identity; may include the denial of legal rights, employment, and housing."},"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000356"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001229"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000356"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/antiQueerDiscrimination"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3"}},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001229","dc:identifier":"homoit0001229","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Queerphobia"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Antagonism or disgust directed towards queerness as an identity or queer people due to their identity, perceived or actual. Queerphobia can include denial of the existence of queerness, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence."},"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000920"},"skos:relat